    <Description>This macro executes a precise Mena Flip — a high-level recovery and speed mechanic used by pro players. It's tailored for setups where Right Click is bound to Jump. The macro perfectly times the movements to replicate the Mena Flip consistently.

 Setup Requirements:

"Jump" must be bound to Right Click in Rocket League.

Assign this macro to your chosen hotkey within Keyran.

 What it does:

Initiates a short jump (Right Click)

Begins a diagonal flip combined with air roll

Times the second jump mid-flip to cancel and boost momentum

Results in a fast, smooth recovery or speed gain

 Note: This macro is designed for training or casual play. Avoid using in competitive modes where macros are prohibited. Use at your own risk.</Description>
